{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43256","headline":"风光草际浮 · 陈璀","name":"风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风泛摇草，旭日遍神州。\n已向花间积，还来叶上浮。\n晓光缘圃丽，芳气满街流。\n澹荡依朱萼，颻扬带玉沟。\n向空看转媚，临水见弥幽。\n况被崇兰色，王孙正可游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈璀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}